; `commit` uses `load`'s own selective-export rule: an *unlabelled* fact stays inside the
; sandbox even when the sandbox itself is kept, exactly like an unlabelled fact in a `load`ed
; file never travels to whoever loads it (see doc/kurt-doc.md's `load` section).
load prop
bool C
sandbox
    use C
    commit
expect "ProofError"
    C
;;; Proof checked.
